                <note rend="inline" type="source">550.E1/291: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Ambassador in Italy</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Child</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-05-18T12:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">May 18,
                                1922—noon</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>14. No objection to your receiving Krassin privately, unofficially and
                    confidentially.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
